    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Uncover the truth</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the fractured reality of the\u00a0<i>Tragedy at Ashville Lane</i>, a psychological horror experience that blurs the line between the seen and the imagined. Set within the oppressive walls of a creaking, labyrinthine house, the game immerses players in the unraveling psyche of a man struggling with inner demons that take a hauntingly real form.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427610/extras/520d63f69952967fa50544beee66b7d6.poster.avif?t=1737974268\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427610/extras/520d63f69952967fa50544beee66b7d6.webm?t=1737974268\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427610/extras/520d63f69952967fa50544beee66b7d6.mp4?t=1737974268\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The house is alive with chilling sounds, shadowy figures, and an atmosphere that shifts with the protagonist's fragile state of mind. Solve intricate puzzles, uncover hidden memories, and tread carefully as every creak of the floorboards might herald the arrival of something you can\u2019t fully understand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427610/extras/fa3ae5165abe975e299424d6c678e43a.poster.avif?t=1737974268\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427610/extras/fa3ae5165abe975e299424d6c678e43a.webm?t=1737974268\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427610/extras/fa3ae5165abe975e299424d6c678e43a.mp4?t=1737974268\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The experience is enhanced by a fully interactable inventory and environment, where every object might hold a clue\u2014or a chilling revelation. Carefully inspect your surroundings, collect items, and piece them together to solve intricate puzzles that are essential to progressing through the story. The house itself feels like a living entity, with hidden secrets waiting to be uncovered. Every drawer opened, every book examined, and every object picked up could hold the key to unlocking the protagonist\u2019s mind\u2014or unleashing deeper horrors. Stay vigilant, as the environment is as much an ally as it is a threat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427610/extras/9b5dee98afa8e5cd9937ac0db388b382.poster.avif?t=1737974268\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427610/extras/9b5dee98afa8e5cd9937ac0db388b382.webm?t=1737974268\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427610/extras/9b5dee98afa8e5cd9937ac0db388b382.mp4?t=1737974268\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Uncover the truth</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the fractured reality of the\u00a0<i>Tragedy at Ashville Lane</i>, a psychological horror experience that blurs the line between the seen and the imagined. Set within the oppressive walls of a creaking, labyrinthine house, the game immerses players in the unraveling psyche of a man struggling with inner demons that take a hauntingly real form.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427610/extras/520d63f69952967fa50544beee66b7d6.poster.avif?t=1737974268\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427610/extras/520d63f69952967fa50544beee66b7d6.webm?t=1737974268\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427610/extras/520d63f69952967fa50544beee66b7d6.mp4?t=1737974268\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The house is alive with chilling sounds, shadowy figures, and an atmosphere that shifts with the protagonist's fragile state of mind. Solve intricate puzzles, uncover hidden memories, and tread carefully as every creak of the floorboards might herald the arrival of something you can\u2019t fully understand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427610/extras/fa3ae5165abe975e299424d6c678e43a.poster.avif?t=1737974268\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427610/extras/fa3ae5165abe975e299424d6c678e43a.webm?t=1737974268\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427610/extras/fa3ae5165abe975e299424d6c678e43a.mp4?t=1737974268\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The experience is enhanced by a fully interactable inventory and environment, where every object might hold a clue\u2014or a chilling revelation. Carefully inspect your surroundings, collect items, and piece them together to solve intricate puzzles that are essential to progressing through the story. The house itself feels like a living entity, with hidden secrets waiting to be uncovered. Every drawer opened, every book examined, and every object picked up could hold the key to unlocking the protagonist\u2019s mind\u2014or unleashing deeper horrors. Stay vigilant, as the environment is as much an ally as it is a threat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427610/extras/9b5dee98afa8e5cd9937ac0db388b382.poster.avif?t=1737974268\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427610/extras/9b5dee98afa8e5cd9937ac0db388b382.webm?t=1737974268\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427610/extras/9b5dee98afa8e5cd9937ac0db388b382.mp4?t=1737974268\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
